OL,3,GNEWSABBC 3CR Make a Difference Award
OL,4,Awinners announced
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old ambassador for a
OL,7,Fbereavement charity is one of the
OL,8,Fwinners of BBC Three Counties Radio's
OL,9,FMake a Difference Awards 2026.
OL,11,FEvie Everett's dad Scott died when she
OL,12,Fwas four. Evie, her sister and mother
OL,13,Fwere supported by Stand By Me - a
OL,14,Fcharity based in Hitchin,
OL,15,FHertfordshire.
OL,17,F"I know how it is to lose someone. The
OL,18,Fcharity helped me understand that it's
OL,19,FOK to feel everything you feel and I
OL,20,Fwant others to feel supported too,"
OL,21,Fsaid Evie.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
